{"id":"48c6bd62556aaf70","group":"67","path":"67/67-df-decidable.md","title":"Decidable Theorem Set","display":"df-decidable — Decidable Theorem Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-df-decidable","aliases":["67-df-decidable"],"display":"df-decidable — Decidable Theorem Set","depends_on":["[[67-df-sentence]]","[[67-df-godel-encoding]]","[[67-df-prim-provability]]","[[67-df-recursive-function-class]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":1,"source_label":"decidable theory","source_printed_pages":17,"source_pdf_pages":28,"source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-df-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-df-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-decidable — Decidable Theorem Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"decidable theory"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"17"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"28"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 为公理集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 为固定有效 Gödel 编号；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"854772391cef4007\" href=\"?note=854772391cef4007\" title=\"67-df-sentence\">67-df-sentence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e5654af7c954e1c0\" href=\"?note=e5654af7c954e1c0\" title=\"67-df-godel-encoding\">67-df-godel-encoding</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\)</span> 是自然数上的一元全递归函数类，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5f966a5415552b4e\" href=\"?note=5f966a5415552b4e\" title=\"67-df-recursive-function-class\">67-df-recursive-function-class</a>；可推导性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"573b4c635ea6d91f\" href=\"?note=573b4c635ea6d91f\" title=\"67-df-prim-provability\">67-df-prim-provability</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span> 是下式定义的元语言谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{ran}(\\chi)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (\\chi(n)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\ (g(\\varphi)=n\\land T\\vdash\\varphi))\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Decidable}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{ran}(\\chi)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (\\chi(n)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\ (g(\\varphi)=n\\land T\\vdash\\varphi))\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>原书 p.17 判定的是 Th(T)，不是公理成员资格。非法句子编码返回 0。上游 Rec 是谓词，故本条明确复用 Rec_1 函数类，修复原先把谓词当作集合的签名错误。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-godel-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f966a5415552b4e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 为公理集合，$g$ 为固定有效 Gödel 编号；见 [[67-df-sentence]]、[[67-df-godel-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-godel-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"e5654af7c954e1c0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 为公理集合，$g$ 为固定有效 Gödel 编号；见 [[67-df-sentence]]、[[67-df-godel-encoding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"5f966a5415552b4e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}_1$ 是自然数上的一元全递归函数类，见 [[67-df-recursive-function-class]]；可推导性见 [[67-df-prim-provability]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}_1$ 是自然数上的一元全递归函数类，见 [[67-df-recursive-function-class]]；可推导性见 [[67-df-prim-provability]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_1\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{ran}(\\chi)\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (\\chi(n)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\ (g(\\varphi)=n\\land T\\vdash\\varphi))\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1973,"backlinks":[{"id":"b488bd715fda08a1","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$ 在同一有效语言中；$\\mathrm{Cn}_L$ 见 [[67-df-theory-closed]]，$\\mathrm{Decidable}$ 见 [[67-df-decidable]]。"},{"id":"0e0d50a09d6e5d48","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"exc